 increase awareness and accelerate the development of SoCs/IPs with fewer weaknesses and vulnerabilities, Trust-Hub compiles the most comprehensive list of security IPs and security-aware CAD/EDA tools, a summary of their associated metrics and capabilities, and the names of their developers. This list includes mature tools/IPs from the industry, tool/IP prototypes from academic researchers, and proposed methods (as low as TRL1) with a high potential to be implemented as future tools/IPs. As a part of this effort, Trust-Hub also plans on creating connections between prospective sponsors and community researchers, such as matchmaking meetings/events on the prototype tools/IPs that sponsors are most interested in.\n"),Ua(),Ba(4,"p"),xs(5,"The expected outcomes of this initiative are as follows:"),Ua(),Ba(6,"ul"),Ba(7,"li"),xs(8," The creation of a security-aware ecosystem of CAD/EDA tools and IPs, which will be beneficial for all parties from academia, industry, and government; "),Ua(),Ba(9,"li"),xs(10," An increase in the interactions/collaborations between academia and industry; "),Ua(),Ba(11,"li"),xs(12," Exposure for new tools/IPs from major CAD/EDA companies and for start-up companies trying to commercialize their prototypes; "),Ua(),Ba(13,"li"),xs(14," An increase in the level of investment from industry in academic research, especially to incorporate features of prototype solutions into their products; "),Ua(),Ba(15,"li"),xs(16," An increase in the government\u2019s funding level will show what tools/IPs are currently available and where the current gaps remain. "),Ua(),Ua(),Ba(17,"p"),xs(18," If you would like to promote your Hardware Security IP and CAD solutions on Trust-Hub and participate in this effort, please complete the form found "),Ba(19,"a",0),xs(20,"here"),Ua(),xs(21,". Note that you might need to clear your browser\u2019s cache to submit multiple solutions in the form.\n"),Ua(),Va(22,"hr"),Ba(23,"p"),xs(24,"Please do not hesitate to contact us if 